cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "langton-ga: distributed evolutionary search over generalized Langton ants"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free Rust research testbed for distributed evolutionary search
  over generalized Langton ants (turmites). It includes a sparse-grid simulator,
  a four-island asynchronous genetic algorithm over TCP, telemetry, a verified
  highway detector, a reproducible experiment suite, and a paper snapshot.
type: software
